id: zigbee_system_common
label: Application Framework Common
package: zigbee
category: Zigbee|Utility
quality: production
description: This component declares all the required application framework globals, initializes the Zigbee stack and dispatches stack callbacks calls as needed to the application components.

provides:
- name: zigbee_system_common
- name: wireless_stack
  allow_multiple: true
config_file:
- path: app/framework/common/config/zigbee_sleep_config.h
- path: app/framework/common/config/sl_zigbee_rtos_task_config.h
  condition:
  - cmsis_rtos2
requires:
- name: zigbee_pro_stack_support
- name: zigbee_enhanced_routing
- name: zigbee_phy
- name: event_system
  condition:
  - cmsis_rtos2
- name: memory_manager
  condition:
  - cmsis_rtos2
- name: cmsis_rtos2
  condition:
  - bluetooth_stack
- name: rail_lib_multiprotocol
  condition:
  - bluetooth_stack
- name: nvm3_lib
  condition:
  - bluetooth_stack
- name: rail_util_pti
  condition:
  - device_cortexm
- name: power_manager
  condition:
  - device_cortexm
- name: cmsis_rtos2
  condition:
  - ot_stack
- name: rail_mux
  condition:
  - ot_stack
  # UID 1327639 : To prevent difference in behavior in the rail mux
  # scheduled rx operation with and without DMP, we will enable DMP by default
  # this will reduce the complexity in deadling with this in the mux layer
- name: rail_lib_multiprotocol
  condition:
  - ot_stack
  - rail_util_ieee802154_fast_channel_switching
  # Free RTOS Heap 3 implementation matches Micrium's the closest
  # Generally, we default to Heap 4. Therefore, we explicitly set this
  # to heap 3.
- name: freertos_heap_3
  condition:
  - freertos
- name: radio_priority_15_4
  condition:
  - device_cortexm

recommends:
- id: zigbee_phy_2_4
  vendor: silabs
- id: freertos
  condition:
  - bluetooth_stack
  vendor: silabs
- id: freertos
  condition:
  - ot_stack

  vendor: silabs
source:
- path: app/framework/common/sl_zigbee_system_common.c
- path: app/framework/common/zigbee_app_framework_stack_cb.c
  condition:
  - zigbee_system_common_app_framework
- path: app/framework/common/zigbee_app_framework_stack_cb.c
  condition:
  - native_host
- path: app/framework/common/zigbee_stack_sleep.c
  # This will be included from security-address-cache.c with root path from 
  # There are more than one security.h, hence adding here as resource instead of include file_list.
- path: app/util/security/security.h
- path: app/framework/common/zigbee_stack_rtos_adaptation.c
  condition:
  - cmsis_rtos2
- path: stack/internal/src/baremetal/security_baremetal_wrapper.c
  unless:
  - zigbee_use_ipc
  - native_host
- path: stack/internal/src/ipc/zigbee_ipc_callback_event_stub.c
  condition:
  - zigbee_use_ipc
- path: stack/internal/src/ipc/security_ipc_command_messages.c
  condition:
  - zigbee_use_ipc
- path: stack/internal/src/ipc/security_ipc_callback_events.c
  condition:
  - zigbee_use_ipc
- path: stack/internal/src/baremetal/security_baremetal_callbacks.c
  unless:
  - zigbee_use_ipc
  - native_host
- path: stack/internal/src/ipc/zigbee_ipc_callback_events.c
  condition:
  - zigbee_use_ipc
include:
- path: app/framework/common
  file_list:
  - path: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
  - path: zigbee_app_framework_event.h
  - path: zigbee_app_framework_callback.h
- path: app/framework/common
  file_list:
  - path: zigbee_rtos_adaptation.h
  condition:
  - cmsis_rtos2
- path: stack/internal/src/ipc
  file_list:
  - path: zigbee_ipc_callback_events.h
  - path: zigbee_ipc_command_messages.h
  # PLATFORM_MTL-5145 : Temporary workaround until Platform Montreal incorporates this into their repo
  # This file is required in order to set LIB_MEM_CFG_HEAP_SIZE to 0
  # This also requires a project define symbol OS_CFG_COMPAT_INIT
  # When this symbol is defined, this file os_cfg_app.h is required
- path: app/framework/common
  file_list:
  - path: os_cfg_app.h
  condition:
  - cmsis_rtos2

- path: stack/internal/src/ipc
  file_list:
  - path: security_ipc_callback_events.h
  - path: security_ipc_command_messages.h
  - path: zigbee_ipc_callback_events.h
  - path: zigbee_ipc_command_messages.h
  condition:
  - cmsis_rtos2
- path: stack/internal/inc
  file_list:
  - path: security_internal_def.h

# NOTE: Some cflags come in via platform/common/toolchain/toolchains.slct
# Example: -Wall, -Wextra. So there is no need to explicitly add them
#toolchain_settings:
    # turn on warnings as errors only when compiling from source

template_file:
- path: app/framework/common/template/zigbee_stack_callback_dispatcher.h.jinja
- path: app/framework/common/template/zigbee_stack_callback_dispatcher.c.jinja
- path: app/framework/common/template/zigbee_common_callback_dispatcher.h.jinja
- path: app/framework/common/template/zigbee_common_callback_dispatcher.c.jinja

template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: zigbee_system_common
- name: event_handler
  value:
    event: stack_init
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_zigbee_stack_init_callback
  priority: -8999
  unless:
  - cmsis_rtos2
- name: event_handler
  value:
    event: stack_init
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_zigbee_app_framework_init_callback
  priority: -8998
  unless:
  - cmsis_rtos2
- name: event_handler
  value:
    event: stack_init
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_zigbee_stack_rtos_task_init_cb
  priority: -8999
  condition:
  - cmsis_rtos2
- name: event_handler
  value:
    event: stack_permanent_allocation
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_zigbee_stack_rtos_perm_allocation
  priority: -8999
  condition: [sl_main, cmsis_rtos2]
- name: event_handler
  value:
    event: stack_permanent_allocation
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_legacy_buffer_manager_initialize_buffers
  priority: -8999
  condition: [sl_main]
- name: event_handler
  value:
    event: stack_process_action
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_zigbee_stack_tick_callback
  unless:
  - cmsis_rtos2
- name: event_handler
  value:
    event: stack_process_action
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_zigbee_app_framework_tick_callback
  unless:
  - cmsis_rtos2
- name: event_handler
  value:
    event: stack_init
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_zigbee_stack_sleep_init
  priority: -8998
  condition:
  - power_manager
- name: power_manager_handler
  value:
    event: is_ok_to_sleep
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_zigbee_app_framework_is_ok_to_sleep
  condition:
  - power_manager
  - zigbee_zcl_framework_core
- name: power_manager_handler
  value:
    event: is_ok_to_sleep
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_zigbee_stack_is_ok_to_sleep
  condition:
  - power_manager
- name: power_manager_handler
  value:
    event: sleep_on_isr_exit
    include: sl_zigbee_system_common.h
    handler: sli_zigbee_stack_sleep_on_isr_exit
  condition:
  - power_manager
- name: cli_group
  value:
    group: plugin
    name: idle-sleep
    help: Commands to control idling/sleeping of the device
  condition:
  - power_manager
  - zigbee_zcl_framework_core

- name: cli_command
  value:
    group: idle-sleep
    name: status
    handler: sl_zigbee_af_idle_sleep_status_command
    help: Display the sleep status
  condition:
  - power_manager
  - zigbee_zcl_framework_core

- name: cli_command
  value:
    group: idle-sleep
    name: force-awake
    handler: sl_zigbee_af_idle_sleep_stay_awake_command
    help: Set or clear force awake
    argument:
    - type: uint8
  condition:
  - power_manager
  - zigbee_zcl_framework_core

- name: cli_command
  value:
    group: idle-sleep
    name: awake-when-not-joined
    handler: sl_zigbee_af_idle_sleep_awake_when_not_joined_command
    help: Set or clear stay awake when not joined
    argument:
    - type: uint8
  condition:
  - power_manager
  - zigbee_zcl_framework_core

- name: cli_command
  value:
    group: idle-sleep
    name: power-mode-performance
    handler: sl_zigbee_af_idle_sleep_power_mode_performance_command
    help: Set Power mode to performance
  condition:
  - power_manager
  - zigbee_zcl_framework_core
  - device_series_3

- name: cli_command
  value:
    group: idle-sleep
    name: power-mode-eco
    handler: sl_zigbee_af_idle_sleep_power_mode_eco_command
    help: Set Power mode to eco
  condition:
  - power_manager
  - zigbee_zcl_framework_core
  - device_series_3

- name: cli_command
  value:
    name: radio-rx-duty-cycle
    handler: sl_zigbee_af_radio_rx_duty_cycle_command
    help: Start radio duty cycling on rx.
  condition:
  - sl_rail_util_ieee802154_rx_duty_cycling
  - device_series_3

tag:
- idle-sleep
- rtos
- priority
- stack-size
- stay-awake-when-not-joined
- minimum-sleep-duration
- sleep-backoff
- button-stay-awake

documentation:
  docset: zigbee
  document: zigbee-af-api/app-framework-common
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: MSLA
root_path: zigbee
